{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins in the narrow lanes of Mumbai's slums, where dreams are as scarce as opportunities. But you have something special \u2013 an unbreakable spirit and a passion for cricket.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gully Champ is a unique blend of visual novel storytelling, card-based strategy, and open-world RPG elements that tells the emotional journey of a young cricket prodigy fighting against all odds to reach the pinnacle of international cricket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story That Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deeply personal narrative as you navigate the challenges of poverty, family expectations, social barriers, and fierce competition. Every choice you make shapes your character's personality, relationships, and ultimately, their path to greatness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel Excellence</strong>: Beautifully illustrated story sequences with branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Characters</strong>: Build relationships with coaches, teammates, rivals, and loved ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Setting</strong>: Explore a vibrant recreation of Mumbai, from bustling street cricket matches to prestigious cricket academies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Cricket Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cricket isn't just about power \u2013 it's about strategy and your knowledge.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Match System</strong>: Use your deck of batting shots batting shots\u00a0 and special abilities to become a cricket legend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Matches</strong>: Adapt your strategy based on pitch conditions, weather,  and match situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Progression</strong>: Unlock new  abilities as you train and improve</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Train, Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your training ground.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Mumbai</strong>: Freely explore different neighbourhoods, each with unique opportunities and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Stories &amp; NPCs</strong>: Help local shopkeepers and befriend street kids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Attribute System</strong>: Upgrade batting,  mental strength, and leadership through various activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong>: Practice in nets, play street cricket, participate in local tournaments and reach your goal.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099640?t=1761980782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099640/51cdf1dc9a973a3df0ac8848b9e824554ea206b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761980782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099640/1f0ffefbebd04925951ed03aad36425906dbc8dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761980782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099640/1f0ffefbebd04925951ed03aad36425906dbc8dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761980782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins in the narrow lanes of Mumbai's slums, where dreams are as scarce as opportunities. But you have something special \u2013 an unbreakable spirit and a passion for cricket.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gully Champ is a unique blend of visual novel storytelling, card-based strategy, and open-world RPG elements that tells the emotional journey of a young cricket prodigy fighting against all odds to reach the pinnacle of international cricket.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story That Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deeply personal narrative as you navigate the challenges of poverty, family expectations, social barriers, and fierce competition. Every choice you make shapes your character's personality, relationships, and ultimately, their path to greatness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel Excellence</strong>: Beautifully illustrated story sequences with branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Characters</strong>: Build relationships with coaches, teammates, rivals, and loved ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Setting</strong>: Explore a vibrant recreation of Mumbai, from bustling street cricket matches to prestigious cricket academies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Cricket Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cricket isn't just about power \u2013 it's about strategy and your knowledge.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Match System</strong>: Use your deck of batting shots batting shots\u00a0 and special abilities to become a cricket legend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Matches</strong>: Adapt your strategy based on pitch conditions, weather,  and match situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Progression</strong>: Unlock new  abilities as you train and improve</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Train, Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is your training ground.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Mumbai</strong>: Freely explore different neighbourhoods, each with unique opportunities and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side Stories &amp; NPCs</strong>: Help local shopkeepers and befriend street kids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Attribute System</strong>: Upgrade batting,  mental strength, and leadership through various activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong>: Practice in nets, play street cricket, participate in local tournaments and reach your goal.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Innovate Private Limited"],"genres":[{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099640/26b322001ff2796989cf059936d2e51e38510c82/header.jpg?t=1761980782","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099640/561851545/0622aae87019fccde1d65676d521fee994bb7f96/1761297386/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761799145","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099640/561851545/0622aae87019fccde1d65676d521fee994bb7f96/1761297386/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761799145","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099640/561851545/0622aae87019fccde1d65676d521fee994bb7f96/1761297386/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761799145","id":257216933,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216933/movie480.mp4?t=1761799145","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216933/movie_max.mp4?t=1761799145"},"name":"GamePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216933/1948f7d2589296e88a92ab638d7258e501013de4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761799145","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216933/movie480.webm?t=1761799145","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216933/movie_max.webm?t=1761799145"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099640/19990814/86b733563f2fc1deef8042a6baa871d9fd0a772d/1761297474/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761799147","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099640/19990814/8